# 0.1.18, Grab moves: Stun when dropped, and the wrench's hit on the stunned one, on an enemy that stands alone:
# Eudora's Blarg trooper (QUEST_SIM_GIVE=12 QUEST_SIM_HOLD=12 QUEST_SIM_NEAR=427 QUEST_SIM_NEAR_AT=6,0, --level 4; Y at
# 1150 skips its arrival movie; he is put before it at about frame 1990). grabstun.sim does the same on Novalis, where
# two critters stand a unit apart and the other one, coming at him, takes the sweep in most runs. Caught and reeled in,
# the trigger let go with the hand still: "[vr-grab] dropped", "dropped: stunned for 1.5 s" about two units before the
# hand. The right grip takes the wrench, a step in, and the hand sweeps across, back and across again: "[vr-wrench] hit
# slot N" with N the slot of "the hook out to slot N", "[vr-grab] slot N let go: a hit on it (record R): the game's to
# take", "[vr-hit] slot N after the hit".
